  "journal": {
    "s16_sixth_fragment": {
      "title": "The Sixth Fragment",
      "text": "Tidewatch, the harbour of Thalassia. Captain Maren's divers had found Thalassia's fragment beneath the old coastal watch, and then the tremors brought half the watch down on top of it. We helped on the docks first: three split cargo barrels lashed down and the loading crane mended. Then I swam out along the buoys, breathing at the bubble lines, cleared the fallen stones in the watch's lower room and lifted out the Tide Anchor. Orin says it was made to hold something steady. On Maren's chart table the six fragments glowed together, the compass needle stopped, and a line of light pointed north toward Awakening Valley. Thalassia joins us, and Maren will carry everyone to Valebridge."
    }
  }
}